        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "京都の骨董市で、江戸時代に作られたという珍しい明石焼きの茶碗を見つけた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "明石焼きは、その素朴で温かみのある風合いが多くの茶人に愛されてきた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "窯元を訪ねて、伝統的な技法で焼かれた明石焼きの皿を購入した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "round balls made from eggs, flour, etc. (local food of Akashi)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "兵庫に旅行へ行った際、本場の明石焼きを熱々の出汁につけて食べた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "たこ焼きも好きだが、卵がたっぷりでふわふわの明石焼きの方がもっと好きだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "屋台から漂ってくる明石焼きの香ばしい匂いに誘われて、つい一つ買ってしまった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
